{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Combatants｜结构图\n外置 ASC 宿主的最小共同契约。[[Combatants/结构|结构文档]] · 玩家 [[Teams/结构]] · Boss [[BossAI/结构]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1530,
      "height": 130,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "base",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## AGGYGOCombatantState【H1/H2/H3源码冻结】\n持ASC／属性集；Avatar选择／复制及原Pawn订阅归Host。\nRequest返回实际历史；只借Extension H。\nDestroyed/EndPlay→唯一Close，均在Super前。\n先关准入；重复不重捕；覆盖pre-BeginPlay。\n有H走原Release；无H真实ClearActorInfo/Receipt。\nflag非成功；Busy／失败保留，不重试／排队。\n只退役原Context或自己的Clear Commit，不清后继。\nH3已入Gate57新DLL；单叶通过，Host换绑未验。",
      "x": 530,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 470,
      "height": 400,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "attr",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## ASC／HealthSet／CombatSet\nHost默认子对象；ASC独占ActorInfo及清理证明。\n组件GetOwner固定Host；ActorInfo可明确全清。\n活跃Host无Avatar仍保留属性/GE/冷却/死亡Tag。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构|ASC原权限]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 320,
      "width": 410,
      "height": 210,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "pawn",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## APawn／PawnExtension【源码已接】\nInit/Release/Refresh兼容入口→Host原请求。\nInstall／NotifyReady／Withdraw／NotifyReleased唯一掌本地H。\nGetter仅真实Ready；当前槽快照不授权限。\n关闭后仍可撤原资源；不执行原生ActorInfo。\n[[Character/结构|原H及typed Notice接口]]",
      "x": 1110,
      "y": 320,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 350,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "slot",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## AGGYGOCharacterSlot\nPawnData 复制回调与 Authority 初始化共用幂等 ASC 规则配置；AbilitySet 仍只由 Authority 授予。[[Teams/结构]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 790,
      "width": 410,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "health",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOHealthComponent\nBase typed Notice转交原H＋Context，源码已接。\nHealth唯一原记录持ASC/HealthSet及五token，原H精确刷新/释放。\nDeathState本地唯一；Dying/Dead单调投影，解绑不清Tag、不隐式复活。\n[[Character/结构|Health/Base原资源]]",
      "x": 530,
      "y": 790,
      "width": 470,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "boss",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## AGGYGOBossState\nBossDefinition 复制回调按初始形态 PawnData 幂等安装 ASC 规则；能力授予仍只由 Authority 执行。[[BossAI/结构]]",
      "x": 1110,
      "y": 790,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "contract",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## ASC原清理接口与当前验证\nCheckAvatarBindingCleanupContext(ExpectedContext, OutReason)→原提交清理资格；可含精确Revoked，非新工作资格。\nTryCleanupFailedAvatarActorInfoInit(原Operation, pure query)→仅清原失败actual写入；Init仍失败，无Receipt/Notice/Ready。\nHost明确Clear模式：Closing→ClearActorInfo；活跃持久Owner普通解绑→PreserveOwner；拒绝不换模式重试。\nH3：Destroyed/EndPlay→唯一Close(Super前)，覆盖pre-BeginPlay；有H原Release，无H真实Clear/Receipt，非Extension通知。\nflag仅准入／单次派发；Busy／失败保留。Invalidate仅原Context或自己Clear Commit，元数据退休≠物理Clear；重复不重捕后继。\nHost/Extension/Health/Base已接；Hero A动作消费者源码冻结、有限接受，旧Pressed/Released/两参数Queue已移除；B typed H/Source→CMC未接。\nBuild55/56旧失败保留；Gate57成功：9 actions/37.13s/7 UHT文件，runtime与Editor DLL已链接，H3/Hero A已入新DLL。\n18:06:35 NativeLifecycleAndHistory单叶Success，事件段0错误/0警告；不证明原R0(2 Fail/12 errors)、真实Host换绑、Hero B或Teams正式装配；正式资产/网络待统筹。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构|ASC唯一权限]] · [[Combatants/结构#关键实现：实际提交、发布与退出|原请求及清理]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1100,
      "width": 1450,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "combatants-host-port",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## IGGYGOAvatarBindingHostInterface\nRequestAvatarBinding(Request)→native同步结果。\n原weak Host/ASC/Pawn/Extension＋Context/H。\nInit空H；Release/Refresh需原H＋完整Context。\n返回实际ASC/Local/Input Steps，不授当前Ready/清理权限。\nHost已实现；Extension三入口已请求。\nASC组件GetOwner定位原端口，不用ActorInfo Owner。\nBusy不排队；不新增Ready或第二证明。\n[[Character/结构#Host原生请求接口（已定义，生产迁移中）|接口契约]]",
      "x": 1720,
      "y": 320,
      "width": 540,
      "height": 420,
      "color": "4"
    }
  ],
